    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「休日の夜にわざわざ時間つくってきてくれたんだから、せめて目一杯楽しんでってね♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-dress",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-dress_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「って、何でわたしが司会みたいなことやってるかっていうとね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「このダンスパーティは生徒会が主催してるんだけど、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「進行や演出その他もろもろは、演劇部が担当してるの！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-dress",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-dress_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「いやぁ、こないだ帰ってきたうちの部長がそういうの好きでね♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-dress",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-dress_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「なので演劇部がこのイベントを利用して、ちょっとした催しをします！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-dress",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-dress_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「それは！　ファッションショーで〜すっ、どんどんぱふぱふっ☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-dress",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-dress_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「みんな美術部のみんながせっせとつくってくれたドレスを着てると思うけど、どれもすっごく可愛いよね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「そのドレスを誰がいちばん着こなしてるか、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 60,
    "dress": "old-dress",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-dress_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「その魅力を引きだしてるか、演劇部が勝手に審査しちゃいま〜す！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちづる",
    "text": "「見事、優勝したひとにはおね〜さんがチュウしてあげる♪」"
